<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar firms to 475/476 against dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar firms to 475/476 against dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar firmed slightly to close at 475.00/476.00 per dollar in moderate trade as the Central Bank met demand for dollars, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Interbank trade was busy ... the Central Bank, as always, was in the market,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>Other traders took a quieter view of the session. &quot;It was a balanced and generally quiet day,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
